T_OUT_OF_WINDOW{from, to}. A repeated Idempotency-Key returns the same response, also a 409/422. Requires FREE_TRAINING. Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"bookTraining","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrainingBookingRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"TrainingBooking","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrainingBooking"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR, SLOT_NOT_ON_GRID","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"OVERRIDE_NOT_ALLOWED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED, DOG_NOT_ACCESSIBLE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"SLOT_TAKEN, TRAINING_LIMIT_REACHED, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"DOG_ALREADY_BOOKED, DOG_NOT_ALLOWED, RING_NOT_RESERVABLE, SLOT_OUT_OF_WINDOW, CLUB_CLOSED, BOOKING_BLOCKED, INACTIVITY_PERIOD, MEMBER_LEAVING, MEMBER_NOT_ACTIVE, DOG_NOT_ACTIVE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/training-bookings/{id}/cancellation":{"post":{"tags":["clubs.training"],"summary":"cancelTraining","description":"Roles: MEMBER (own or family group, also the impersonation token). R-09-10: until startsAt - training.cancelThresholdMinutes; later only with the impersonation token and a reason (ADMIN_LATE, audited). A booking block never prevents it; a second call is INVALID_STATE. details TRAINING_CANCEL_TOO_LATE{thresholdMinutes, minutesBefore}. An optional Idempotency-Key replays the same 200. Requires FREE_TRAINING. Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"cancelTraining","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrainingCancellationRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"TrainingBooking","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrainingBooking"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"INVALID_STATE, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"TRAINING_CANCEL_TOO_LATE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"Forbidden","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"Not Implemented","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"description":"Client error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"5XX":{"description":"Server error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/tasks":{"get":{"tags":["clubs.followup"],"summary":"tasks","description":"Roles: MEMBER for their own dogs (also the impersonation token; not the family group's → 404 DOG_NOT_ACCESSIBLE), INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN (another club's or an unknown dog → 404). Task history of a dog (26, 13), createdAt desc, each with its live attachments and a 5-minute signed url: PENDING and DONE by default (includeDone=true, S10 §6); includeDone=false keeps PENDING; state picks one state and wins over includeDone; includeDeleted adds the deleted tasks, ADMIN only (otherwise 403). page ≥ 0, size 1–200. Requires TASKS (MODULE_DISABLED). Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"tasks","parameters":[{"name":"dogId","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"state","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["PENDING","DONE"]}},{"name":"includeDone","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","default":true}},{"name":"includeDeleted","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","default":false}},{"name":"page","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","default":0}},{"nam