{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/followup/filter-values":{"get":{"tags":["clubs.followup"],"summary":"followupFilterValues","description":"Roles: INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN (MEMBER → 403; impersonation → IMPERSONATION_DENIED). CONVENCIONS_API §4 for D14's universal filter (S10 §6, E75): the top 50 values of field (one of GET /followup's x-filterable fields; any other is INVALID_FILTER), each with its count over the whole set that filter and q select, never one page; the filters on field itself are left out. unread is the caller's own (R-10-13: read marks are per account), so two instructors get different counts. Labels: the member's full name, the dog's name and the author's name (as their newest row stores it); kind and unread their values, as is an id whose record is gone. q narrows the set as the list's search does. Requires TASKS (MODULE_DISABLED). Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"followupFilterValues","parameters":[{"name":"field","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"q","in":"query","description":"The list's q: the member's full name, the dog's name, the author's name or the text","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"filter","in":"query","description":"The list's filters (field:op:value, repeated); only x-filterable fields","required":false,"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"FilterValues","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FilterValues"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR, INVALID_FILTER","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"MODULE_DISABLED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref