      "/api/v1/tasks" : {
        "get" : {
          "description" : "Roles: MEMBER for their own dogs (also the impersonation token; not the family group's → 404 DOG_NOT_ACCESSIBLE), INSTRUCTOR, ADMIN (another club's or an unknown dog → 404). Task history of a dog (26, 13), createdAt desc, each with its live attachments and a 5-minute signed url: PENDING and DONE by default (includeDone=true, S10 §6); includeDone=false keeps PENDING; state picks one state and wins over includeDone; includeDeleted adds the deleted tasks, ADMIN only (otherwise 403). page ≥ 0, size 1–200. Requires TASKS (MODULE_DISABLED). Tenant comes from the JWT.",
          "operationId" : "tasks",
          "parameters" : [ {
            "in" : "query",
            "name" : "dogId",
            "required" : true,
            "schema" : {
              "type" : "string"
            }
          }, {
            "in" : "query",
            "name" : "state",
            "required" : false,
            "schema" : {
              "enum" : [ "PENDING", "DONE" ],
              "type" : "string"
            }
          }, {
            "in" : "query",
            "name" : "includeDone",
            "required" : false,
            "schema" : {
              "default" : true,
              "type" : "boolean"
            }
          }, {
            "in" : "query",
            "name" : "includeDeleted",
            "required" : false,
            "schema" : {
